{"id":"torrey:seals","source":"torrey","name":"Seals","slug":"seals","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Called signet — Ge 38:18,25.","refs":[["Gen",38,18,38,18],["Gen",38,25,38,25]]},{"text":"Precious stones set in gold used as — Ex 28:11.","refs":[["Exod",28,11,28,11]]},{"text":"Inscriptions upon, alluded to — 2Ti 2:19.","refs":[["2Tim",2,19,2,19]]},{"text":"Generally worn as rings or bracelets — Jer 22:24.","refs":[["Jer",22,24,22,24]]},{"text":"Frequently taken in clay. — Job 38:14.","refs":[["Job",38,14,38,14]]},{"text":"Used for security. — Da 6:17; Mt 27:66.","refs":[["Dan",6,17,6,17],["Matt",27,66,27,66]]},{"text":"Attached to all royal decrees. — 1Ki 21:8; Es 3:12; 8:8.","refs":[["1Kgs",21,8,21,8],["Esth",3,12,3,12],["Esth",8,8,8,8]]},{"text":"Attached to covenants. — Ne 9:38; 10:1.","refs":[["Neh",9,38,9,38],["Neh",10,1,10,1]]},{"text":"Attached to lease and transfers of property. — Jer 32:9-12,44.","refs":[["Jer",32,9,32,12],["Jer",32,44,32,44]]},{"text":"Set upon treasures. — De 32:34.","refs":[["Deut",32,34,32,34]]},{"text":"Attached to the victims approved for sacrifice, alluded to. — Joh 6:27.","refs":[["John",6,27,6,27]]},{"text":"Were given by kings as a badge of authority. — Ge 41:41,42.","refs":[["Gen",41,41,41,41],["Gen",41,42,41,42]]},{"text":"Circumcision. — Ro 4:11.","refs":[["Rom",4,11,4,11]]},{"text":"Converts. — 1Co 9:2.","refs":[["1Cor",9,2,9,2]]},{"text":"What is dear or valued. — Song 8:6; Jer 22:24; Hag 2:23.","refs":[["Song",8,6,8,6],["Jer",22,24,22,24],["Hag",2,23,2,23]]},{"text":"Secrecy. — Da 12:4; Re 5:1; 10:4.","refs":[["Dan",12,4,12,4],["Rev",5,1,5,1],["Rev",10,4,10,4]]},{"text":"Security. — Song 4:12; 2Ti 2:19; Re 7:2-8; 20:3.","refs":[["Song",4,12,4,12],["2Tim",2,19,2,19],["Rev",7,2,7,8],["Rev",20,3,20,3]]},{"text":"Full approval. — Joh 3:33.","refs":[["John",3,33,3,33]]},{"text":"Appropriation of saints to God by the Spirit. — 2Co 1:22; Eph 1:13; 4:30.","refs":[["2Cor",1,22,1,22],["Eph",1,13,1,13],["Eph",4,30,4,30]]},{"text":"Restraint. — Job 9:7; 37:7; Re 20:3.","refs":[["Job",9,7,9,7],["Job",37,7,37,7],["Rev",20,3,20,3]]}],"refCount":38}
